1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,198
Real customers look at you. Serve them. Refuse anyone else.

2
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:12,500
Ten pork skewers, please. My husband loves them.

3
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:15,700
Coming up.

4
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:22,623
Smells wonderful. Thank you, dear.

5
00:00:22,903 --> 00:00:23,533
Serve.

6
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:31,664
Iced tea, less sugar. I walked a long way.

7
00:00:33,649 --> 00:00:34,659
One iced tea.

8
00:00:37,449 --> 00:00:38,554
Keep the change.

9
00:00:38,834 --> 00:00:39,464
Serve.

10
00:00:45,849 --> 00:00:46,989
Pork. No chili.

11
00:00:49,249 --> 00:00:50,604
She is facing away.

12
00:00:50,884 --> 00:00:52,708
Real customers look at you.

13
00:00:55,449 --> 00:00:56,141
Refuse.

14
00:00:59,449 --> 00:01:01,756
Next night. Which one isn't human?
